# git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# This file lists commits that should be ignored by `git blame`.
# Typically bulk formatting changes (Prettier runs, ESLint --fix, etc.).
#
# Local setup:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# VSCode users: this is configured automatically via .vscode/settings.json.
#
# Add commit hashes below, one per line, with a comment describing the change.
